# .graphifyignore — controls what graphify indexes into the knowledge graph.
# graphify reads THIS file instead of .gitignore when present in the same dir,
# so this is a superset: the meaningful .gitignore rules + graph-specific noise.
# gitignore syntax; last match wins. _SKIP_DIRS (node_modules, .svelte-kit,
# dist, build, graphify-out, …) are always skipped by graphify regardless.

# --- i18n translation catalogs ---------------------------------------------
# 5 JSON files exploded into ~1289 AST nodes (~51% of the old graph) and the
# literal query matcher anchored on them, burying real route/service code.
# Excluded so code-architecture queries surface handlers, not translation keys.
